    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position: [placing the repair stand by the river path entrance where flats actually happen, and chaining the pump because the last one vanished](narr:Position_RepairStandSiteAndPumpSecurity). The frame asks where observed rider need and past loss should dictate placement and protection of public cycling equipment, and the position answers both halves — siting by where breakdowns occur, securing kit against prior theft.""" ;
